1 0 0 1 54 647 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 634 Tm (Purpose:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 621 Tm (PM-KISAN is a Central Sector scheme that gives income support to eligible landholding farmer) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 608 Tm (families. The support is meant to help farmers meet agriculture and household needs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 595 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 582 Tm (Benefits:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 569 Tm (- Rs. 6,000 per year is provided to eligible farmer families.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 556 Tm (- The amount is paid in three equal installments of Rs. 2,000.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 543 Tm (- Payment is transferred directly to the beneficiary bank account through DBT.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 530 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 517 Tm (Eligibility:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 504 Tm (- Eligible beneficiary is a landholding farmer family.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 491 Tm (- For the scheme, family means husband, wife, and minor children.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 478 Tm (- State Governments and Union Territory administrations identify eligible farmer families as) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 465 Tm (per scheme guidelines.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 452 Tm (- Aadhaar and bank account details are important for receiving benefits.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 439 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 426 Tm (Major Exclusions:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 413 Tm (- Institutional landholders are not eligible.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 400 Tm (- Farmer families with members holding constitutional posts are excluded.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 387 Tm (- Former/present Ministers, MPs, MLAs, Mayors, and District Panchayat Chairpersons are) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 374 Tm (excluded.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 361 Tm (- Serving or retired Government employees are generally excluded, except Multi Tasking) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 348 Tm (Staff, Class IV, or Group D employees.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 335 Tm (- Pensioners receiving monthly pension of Rs. 10,000 or more are excluded, except eligible) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 322 Tm (Group D type employees.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 309 Tm (- Income tax payers and registered professionals such as doctors, engineers, lawyers,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 296 Tm (chartered accountants, and architects are excluded.) Tj
